[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从那以后……我好几次试着在海湾过夜。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，鸥再也没出现过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说了自己要离开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"会去远方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"远方究竟是哪里？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥已经不在了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使这艘船完工了，也不能给她看了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么，我做这些到底是为了什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了什么。……为了谁。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了谁？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了鸥。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么……究其缘由，鸥又是为了谁才改造这艘船的？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鹭阿姨说过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥改造这艘船……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘为了大家。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对了。是为了大家，才要改造船的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了读过那本书，写信来的同伴们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了经历过同样探险的朋友们而改造的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么，我……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]